C. Unavailable unless another table exists:
Dedicated event history, formal dependencies or required-action flags.

The profiling output must state which category applies.

Do not derive a cancellation date from modification date unless the business meaning is confirmed.

Do not derive an action dependency merely because one action mentions another in free text.

